---
import Breadcrumbs from '@/components/Breadcrumbs.astro'
import Link from '@/components/Link.astro'
import PageHead from '@/components/PageHead.astro'
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'
import { buttonVariants } from '@/components/ui/button'
---

<Layout class="max-w-7xl ">
  <PageHead slot="head" title="Experience" />
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Experience', icon: 'lucide:pen' }]} />
  <div class="flex py-1 text-6xl" style="margin-top: 10px;"
  >experience
  </div>
  <section>
    <div class="min-w-full">
      <div class="prose mb-8">
        <p class="mt-0"></p>
          Between job positions, a MN Greencorps term, undergraduate studies, and graduate studies, 
          I have been fortunate to have been able to learn skills and gain knowledge for many different subject areas and 
          focuses.<br>
          <br>
          I have done field work for my bachelor's degree and for MN Greencorps, graphic design for the Riley Purgatory Bluff Creek Watershed District (and on my own time), 
          learned about environmental science and sustainability through it all, and am now learning more about coding and development
          at the University of Minnesota.<br>
          <br>
          To read more about specifics of the positions I have held and the experience I have gained, click the button below to view my resume. Thank you! 
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex py-2">
        <Link
            href="src/content/Portoghese_Resume2025.pdf"
            class={buttonVariants({ variant: 'destructive' }) + ' group'}
        >
            Resume
        </Link>
    </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>